{"id":"5172","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5172_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这层中云是高积云。其<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">圆形云团和卷轴</span>视宽为1°-5°，有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阴影</span>。该高积云的具体云种可列为层状云，因为云的天空覆盖范围大。云片很透光，可显露出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">太阳的位置</span>，因此它也是透光云类。在某些地方，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云素之间有空隙</span>，这也表明是漏隙云类，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">长且大致平行的卷轴</span>表明也适用波状云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 36'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 49' 26'' W","date":"31 August 2014 0850 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.7"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5172_syn_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>高压脊延伸越过英国英格兰上空，以及在不列颠诸岛以西的一连串的锋线。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5172_sat_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-undulatus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>图中可见高积云带横跨英国英格兰中南部上空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2013","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4735_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-undulatus-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这层高积云（云种为成层状）显然是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">半透明的（透明云类）</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">各元素之间的间隙可以看到天空（漏光云类）(2)</span>。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">细长的元素几乎彼此平行，表示其为波纹云类(4)</span>。这层云正在覆盖天空。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Albert Reynolds","location":"南非罗伯逊","latitude":"纬度: 33° 47' 44'' S","longitude":"经度: 19° 52' 2'' E","date":"22 May 2014 1412 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 5, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.11"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4739_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-cirru-spissatus-and-stratocumulus-cumulogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这张图像中主要是一层薄薄的几乎白色的层状透光漏光高积云。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">波浪形状</span>（波状云类）正在这层云的东部边缘形成。</p>\n<p>下部是一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>细胞；其中一个正在下<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">阵雨</span>。也存在由低层风<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">切变</span>的中积云细胞。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云的云片</span>是是积云顶部的残余物，它们在稳定的层（积云性）下扩散。更多的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云性层积云</span>正在几个地区形成。</p>\n<p>最后，几块<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>位于高积云以东。没有任何迹象表明这些厚厚的卷云是积雨云上层的残余物。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Phoebe Dill","location":"百慕大圣乔治","latitude":"纬度: 32° 21' 50'' N","longitude":"经度: 64° 39' 6'' W","date":"10 September 2015 1301 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 4, CM= 3, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7 1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7 1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4764_main_atlocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus-at-night-with-a-lunar-corona_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>在这个夜间图像中，薄薄一层的中层云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">透光层状高积云</span>，透过这层云可以看到月亮。在左边缘，云元素之间存在间隙，这也使得它们成为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">漏隙云</span>云类。月球周围的光学现象是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">月华的光环</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sigbjørn Underbakke","location":"挪威","latitude":"纬度: 59° 29' 31'' N","longitude":"经度: 6° 30' 57'' E","date":"27 September 2015 2247 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.2.2 17","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.2.2 17"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5647_main_a-very-thin-low-and-dissolving-sheet-of-altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-perlucidus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>图中大范围浅灰色云片是云素形式的高积云（成层云种）。云素的大小仅小于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一臂距离处的3指宽</span>（这种度量适用于在地平线以上超过30°角看到的那些云素）；这确认是高积云，但也表明该云层位于中云高度范围的下端。这些云素均极薄，可显露出太阳的位置（透光云类），并间隔有明显的小间距晴空（漏隙云类）。</p>\n<p>云片已开始消散；该过程正显露出地平线方向的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云块</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国，爱尔福特，安德烈亚斯沃尔施塔特","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"29 October 2011 0800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7 2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.7 2"}]}]}